<br />
I've already gotten tells from numerous people offering to help in the Sir Lucan attack.<br />
<br />
I will be organising the attack as it is focused on just an item for me, and will probably make a lot of people KOS in Freeport, so it must be done without flaw, and if a problem occurs, it would be considered my fault.<br />
<br />
I'm still looking for a druid to kite brother Jentry, and enough people over level 45 to help hold off other guards.<br />
The strategy I plan on using is set to minimalise adds but I am still going to require at least 12 people 40-55 and probably 2 or 3 55+ to ensure that it all works.<br />
<br />
I've been told that I can give a shout in EC and have pleanty of people to help, so I shouldn't really have to worry about finding higher level people.<br />
<br />
I'll give more details as I get closer to level 40 and have the faction and pieces required for the quest.						</td>
